{"unit_id":"TiChuXiXi__dsh-git-vcs#card-card-zh","repo":"TiChuXiXi/dsh-git-vcs","commit":"cf40b80a7b5dda8e7a41a950c3fdfeddd14ba177","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-git-vcs 是 DSH Web 的 Git 版本管理插件，在右侧栏提供版本管理面板，并通过 host RPC 调用本机 Git。它可查看工作区改动和差异、暂存并提交文件、浏览提交历史与分支，也可管理远程仓库和 stash。面板使用当前会话的工作目录，适合希望在 DSH 内完成日常版本控制的开发者。运行需要 Git 和兼容的 DSH Web 环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:839-864","lib/client.js:806-900","cordis.patch.yml:10-17"]}
{"unit_id":"TiChuXiXi__dsh-git-vcs#card-card-en","repo":"TiChuXiXi/dsh-git-vcs","commit":"cf40b80a7b5dda8e7a41a950c3fdfeddd14ba177","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-git-vcs adds a version control panel to DSH Web. It uses the current session directory and local Git to show changes and diffs, stage and commit files, browse history and branches, and manage remotes and stashes. It requires Git and a compatible DSH Web setup.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:839-864","lib/client.js:806-900","cordis.patch.yml:10-17"]}
